{
  "version": 1,
  "scope": "entry-scalars",
  "note": "Tracy Content API for Tracy SaaS. Pages are built from sections: each page keeps its path in data (urlField: path), and the section collections have no page of their own (urlPattern null; they reach a page through its sections repeater). The chrome is four entries (header CTA, footer brand, footer legal line, footer newsletter), all printed by src/lib/chrome.ts.",
